node_modules

# Output
.output
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler
/.svelte-kit
/build

# Android has no entry here on purpose. The Gradle project is committed — it is
# source, and every manifest, theme and icon edit lives in it — and it carries
# its own `android/.gitignore`, generated by `cap add android` and committed with
# the rest. That file already excludes the build outputs, `local.properties`, and
# the three generated artefacts that matter most: `app/src/main/assets/public` is
# the entire web bundle, recopied by `cap sync` on every build, and
# `capacitor.config.json` / `capacitor.plugins.json` are derived from
# capacitor.config.ts and the installed plugin set. Restating any of it here
# would be two files to keep in agreement for no gain.

# Database (the SQLite file, plus WAL and shared-memory sidecars)
/.data

